<title>USA: Mosinee authorizes 750,000 share buyback.</title>
<headline>Mosinee authorizes 750,000 share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>MOSINEE, Wis. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mosinee Paper Co said Tuesday its board authorized the repurchase from time to time of up to 750,000 shares, or about seven percent of its common stock.</p>
<p>At September 30, the specialty paper producer had 10.5 million shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available for further details.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
